<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">DANIELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Danieli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Danieli</para>
  <para style="mt2">Dani</para>
  <para style="mt1">DANIELI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu iki kikwitangwa kitabu cha Danieli chasimuila wikazi na maona ya mlotezi Danieli umwo Waizilaeli wandaga wakekala watahigwa uko Babeli, na ivo Danieli na weyawe wandaga wahuilwa kwa Mungu. Naho mna kina ulotezi mwe ziisi na si yose. Naho kitabu chalonga mbuli zalailaga lupisi lwa kulawa mwaka 605 mpaka 535 Aho Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa lupisi Danieli umwo akanda mndima mwo ulongozi wa maseuta wane heweligane uko Babeli. Wamanyi wamwenga wahuwila kugamba Danieli mwenye awandikaga kitabu uko Babeli mwo lupisi ulu, mna wamanyi wengi wa haluse wagamba kitabu iki chawandikwagwa uko Izilaeli mwo lupisi lutuhu kulongole, mwo lupisi lwa kaline ya kaidi, (Umwo Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa). Watuhu wahuwila kugamba mmwenga mwe kitabu hicho mwawandikwagwa kwa misimo ihengi. Kitabu cha Danieli kiwandikwa vileke Waislaeli awo wandaga wakekala kwo utumwa wande na kawiilo. Kawiilo idi ni hamwenga na kwe vyeleko vikwiza vikuunga vikale mwe misimo midala. Mnungu alagisa ludole lwakwe lwa kuwahiga maseuta na want'hu wa si nt'huhu kwombokela mbuli zilaile mwo wikazi wa Danieli. viligane ne Biblia, kitabu iki chambiza kuukombaganya mbuli za useuta wa Mnungu mwe Ndagano Imp'ya. Enga Masihi ivo alotelwe mwe kitabu cha Danieli mnango wa 7: 13-14. Amaona ya Danieli mwe mbuli ye misimo yo uheelo itambulwe ni Yesu mwe Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Matayo 24:15 na Maliko 13:14 naho yaligana na Ugubulo wa Yohana. Danieli iviyaiviya afanyanya ulotezi wa Yelemia, Danieli mnango wa kenda mwe misafa ya nk'hongo mpaka msafa wa katatu</para>
  <para style="iot">Ayo yemndani:</para>
  <para style="io">Mbuli za Danieli na wambuyaze uko Babeli mwo lupisi lwo ulongozi wa Nebukadineza. Mwo mnango wa nk'hongo kubula wa kane.</para>
  <para style="io">Kitabu iki cha Danieli chasimuila utapita mwa maona ya seuta Beliteshaza. mnango wa shano.</para>
  <para style="io">Simulizi mwe mbuli ya Danieli kwe dibome dye simba mwo lupisi lwo ulongozi wa seuta Dalio, Mnango wa mtandatu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mbuli yo Ugubulo uwo Danieli enk'higwe ni Mnungu ukulonga mbuli zikuunga zilaile, Mnango wa mfungate kubula wa mlongo na kaidi.</para>
  <para style="io">Danieli asimuila na kutapita maona maidi kwa mazuwa yakwiza. mnango wa mfungate kubula wa mnane.</para>
  <para style="io">Danieli anawalombezela want'hu wakwe naho Gabilieli mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu amwink'ha uhituzi.</para>
  <para style="io">Gabilieli agubula mbuli zikuunga zilaile kulongole hamwenga no lupisi lwo uheelo. Mnango wa mlongo kubula wa mnango wa mlongo na kaidi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s">Danieli na weyawe uko kwa seuta Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />Mwo mwaka wa katatu wo kulongoza kwakwe Yoakimu uyo andaga seuta ywa Yuda, Nebukadineza uyo andaga seuta ywa Babeli aukump'hukilaga na kuutowa mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />Zumbe Mnungu amtendaga seuta Nebukadineza amgwile seuta Yoakimu na kuvitaha vint'hu vimwenga va mwe Nyuma ya Mnungu. Wavugailwa wamwenga awegalaga kwe nyumba ye milungu yakwe uko Babeli, no kuviika vint'hu ivo kwe vyumba ye milungu yakwe.<verse eid="DAN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Ivo Seuta amgambaga mkulu ywa wandima wakwe uyo Ashepenazi amsaguile wamwenga mwa Waizilaeli kulawa mwe zimp'huga ze kiseuta hamwenga na ziya zina nt'hunyo. <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />Awo wande wabwanga watana naho wamanyi, wahinizwe vedi naho wahufu kukehiniza, heweina lema dyodyose, wakuunga wazumilwe kunda mwe nyumba ye kiseuta. Ashepenazi nakaungwa kuwahiniza kusoma na kuwandika ulosi we Kibabeli. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Naho seuta Nebukadineza kasigiila kugamba want'hu awo kila zuwa wenk'higwe nk'hande yedi enga iidya akudya seuta kwa miyaka mitatu vileke weze wakimale ho undiilo wa seuta. <verse eid="DAN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Mwa awo wabwanga wasagulwe wandaga uumwo ni Danieli na Hanania na Mishaeli na Azalia. Woseni awa wandaga ni we dikabila dya Yuda. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Mkulu ywa wambizi wa seuta awenk'haga mazina mah'ya. Danieli etangagwa niye Belishaza, Hanania etangagwa niye Shedilaki, Mishaeli etangagwa niye Meshaki, Azalia naye etangagwa Abenego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Mna Danieli afanyanyaga mwo moyo wakwe kugamba asekulemelwa ni Mnungu kwa kudya nk'hande hegu kunywa divai ya kiseuta, ivo amlombezaga yudya mkulu ywa wambizi ywa seuta amzumile kugamba asekulemelwa ni Mnungu kwa kudya hegu kwa kunywa divai ya kiseuta. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Ivo Mnungu atendaga Danieli aonelwe mbazi ni uyo mkulu ywa wandima wa Nebukadineza akwitangwa Ashepenazi. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Mna yudya mkulu ywa wandima wa Nebukadineza amgambaga Danieli, “Namogoha zumbe ywangu seuta, uyo asigiile uludyo lwenyu. Nii awaoneni kunda hamdamane zifuta zenyu viligane na weenyu we dilika dyenyu? Nomleke hakomwa ni seuta kwajili yenyu.”<verse eid="DAN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Ivo Danieli amgambaga yudya mwamizi uyo aikigwe ni Ashepenazi kunda mkimalizi ywa Danieli na Hanania na Mishaeli na Azalia, <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />“Chakulombeza ukigeze kwa mazuwa mlongo,” “Ukink'he mboga za mani kidye na mazi yo kunywa du, <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />akajika ukiliganyize na awo want'hu wadile uludyo lwa kiseuta, naho ukatende viligane na ivo nouone.”<verse eid="DAN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Ivo mkimalizi yudya awazumilaga niyo awageza mwa idyo kwa mazuwa mlongo. <verse eid="DAN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Mazuwa mlongo yeze yabule, yaonekaga kugamba woho wandaga wadamana naho wandaga na ludole lukint'hile kujink'ha wadya wadyaga uludyo lwa seuta. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Kukongela aho, yudya mkimalizi hawenk'haga nk'hande ya kiseuta, mna agendeelaga kuwenk'ha mboga za mani na mazi yo kunywa du.<verse eid="DAN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Mnungu awenk'haga umanyi na ubala awo wabwanga awane, na kukombaganya mwe vint'hu vingi na kukehiniza. Naho Danieli andaga na umanyi wa kutapita maona na sozi.<verse eid="DAN 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Lupisi lwiikigwe ni seuta lwo kuwegala kwakwe lwize lubule, Ashapenezi awegalaga awo want'hu wose kwa Nebukadineza seuta. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Seuta alongaga nawo wose, mna hakwandaga na want'hu waonekanaga kunda enga ivo wandaga Danieli na Hanania na Mishaeli na Azalia, ivo awo wazumilagwa kukimaila ndima ha seuta. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Mbuli yoyose yauzagwa ni seuta, wabwanga awa awane waonekaga kunda na mizungu na umanyi kujink'ha walaguzi na wasai mwo useuta wose. <verse eid="DAN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Danieli agendeelaga kunda mndima mwe nyumba ye kiseuta mpaka mwo mwaka wa nk'hongo wa seuta Koleshi.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s">Sozi alotile Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />Mwo mwaka wa kaidi wo ulongozi wakwe, seuta Nebukadineza alotaga sozi yamgelega kinyulu niyo aswesa nt'hongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />Ivo seuta awetangaga, wagangana na wagonezi na wasai wa Wakalidayo vileke weze wamgambile kiya alotile. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />Seuta awagambaga, “Hilota sozi inigeile kinyulu, elo naunga nimanye kugamba yanigaaze.”<verse eid="DAN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Woho wamhitulaga seuta kwa milosi ya Kialamu, “Seuta wikale mazuwa yose! kigambile wandima wako nawo nawakutapitile isozi yako.”<verse eid="DAN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Seuta awahitulaga, “Ulosi wenye unilawa, uneva hamnanigambile isozi yangu no kuitapita neniwasajangeni naho nenimole pele zinyumba zenyu. Nigambileni isozi yangu naho niyo mwanitapitila. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Mnanigambila no kunitapitila isozi neniwenk'heni mageleko na nt'hunyo naho nomnde want'hu wakulu. Ivo elo nigambileni no kunitapitila isozi iyo.”<verse eid="DAN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Woho wamhitulaga naho wakamgamba, “Seuta akigambile suwe wandima wakwe isozi yakwe naswe nekimtapitile isozi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Seuta niyo awagamba nyamaleni, “Himanya kugamba mwageza kunazaganya kwaviya hilamula kint'hu kimwenga, <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />uneva hamnanigambile isozi neni wasulumizeni kwa hamwenga. Nivo vikuleka mwageza kunidant'hiliza mkakawiila kugamba mbuli zadaha kunda zedi kwenyu. Mnde kunigambila isozi niho nenimanye kugamba mwadaha kunitapitila.”<verse eid="DAN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Woho wamhitulaga seuta, “Mwe isi hahali yoyose akudaha kudamanya icho akuunga seuta, kwaviya hahali seuta hegu zumbe hegu kilongozi aungaga mbuli enga iyo kwa walaguzi hegu wasai hegu kwa Wakalidayo <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Iki akuuza seuta kitendesa udala. Hahali akudaha kumlagisa seuta, milungu heikwikala mwa want'hu niyo du ikudaha kutenda ivo.”<verse eid="DAN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Ino yamtendaga seuta aihiwe na kunda na maya vamtendaga asigiile kugamba wata mizungu wose mwe isi ya Babeli wakomwe. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Ivo niyo sigilizi yalavigwa kugamba wata umanyi wose wakomwe ikanda ni hamwenga na Danieli na weyawe.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danieli alagiswa ni Mnungu kimwe sozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Umwo kilongozi mkulu ywa wamizi wa seuta aitaga kwo kuwakoma wata mizungu wose wa Babeli, Danieli alongaga naye kwa wengele na mizungu. <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Amuuzaga mndima ywa seuta, “Nii seuta asigiila kwa maya ivi?” Alioko mndima ywa seuta amtambalisaga vedi Danieli.<verse eid="DAN 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Danieli asunguzaga kuita kwa seuta niyo alombeza lupisi vileke amtapitile isozi iyo. <verse eid="DAN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Danieli auyaga kaya niyo akuwagambila weyawe awo, Hanania na Mishaeli na Azalia icho kilaile. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />Awagambaga walombeze mbazi kwa Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu kwajili ye sozi idya vileke yehe na wata mizungu weyawe wase kukomwa hamwenga na wata mizungu watuhu wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Aho nekilo isozi iidya yalagisagwa naho kwa Danieli, niyo Danieli amtogola Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu,<verse eid="DAN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />akagamba, “Mnungu atogolwe mazuwa yose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:20">Mizungu na udahi ananavo yehe.<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />Yehe ahitula lupisi na misimo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">awaika na kuwausa maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:21">ni yehe akwink'hiza mizungu no umanyi.<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />Avitenda vint'hu vifisigwe na va mwe kinyele vimanyike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:22">viya vifisigwe mwo lwiza yehe kavimanya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:22">naho yehe mwenye kazungulukwa ni ung'azi.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />Nakutogola na kukutunya weye Mnungu ywa wakale wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">Kunink'ha mizungu na ludole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">kunink'ha yadya hulombeze</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 2:23">naho kukilagisa cho kumgambila seuta.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danieli amkumbusa seuta isozi na kumgambila kugamba yagaaze.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Ivo Danieli aitaga kwa Alioko uyo asigiilagwa ni seuta kugamba awakome pele wata mizungu wose wa Babeli niyo amgamba, “Use kuwakoma awa want'hu, hake nigale kwa seuta name nenimkumbuse isozi yakwe no kumgambila kugamba nivo yagaaze.”<verse eid="DAN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Aaho Alioko amwigalaga Danieli kwa seuta niyo agamba, “Himuona Myahudi egalwe aha akudaha kuku kumbusa isozi yako no kukugambila nivo agaaze.”<verse eid="DAN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Seuta amuuzaga Danieli uyo akwitangwa Belitishaza, “Weye wadaha kunigambila kiya nilotile naho niyo wanitapitila?”<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Danieli niyo ahitula, “Hahali mnt'hu mta umanyi hegu msai hegu mgangana hegu mgonezi naadahe kukugambila isozi yako no kukutapitila. <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />Mna eyuko Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu akudaha kuzitenda sozi zimanyike. Yehe kamlagisa seuta akwitangwa Nebukadineza kiya kikuunga kilaile mwa mazuwa yakwiza.<verse eid="DAN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />“Weye seuta, umwo wandaga kugona walotaga sozi zakulagisaga mbuli zikuunga zilaile, niyo yudya akutenda mbuli ze kinyele zimanyike akulagisa mbuli zikuunga zilaile. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Mna mbuli izi hazitendigwe zimanyike kwangu kwaviya nna mizungu itendese kujink'ha wose, mna zitendigwa zimanyike kwangu vileke weye seuta ukombaganye zifanyanyi zo moyo wako.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />“Weye seuta, wakaulaga naho waonaga hili tali dyakimalaga naho dyang'alisaga naho dyawatendaga want'hu wogohese. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Mtwi wakwe wandaga udamanywa kwa zahabu ikukise, kifuwa chake ne mikono yakwe navo vandaga vidamaywa kwa masawa, izinda zakwe ne mawambo yakwe vidamanywa kwa shaba, <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />iviga vakwe navo ivo vidamaywa kwa kilama, nyayo zakwe nazo zidamanywa kwa kilama, nt'hendelo int'huhu yandaga ya ulongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />Umwo wandaga ukadikaula, dihili idyo, kwalailaga iwe dyamokaga ko mnima haheina kukwafigwa ni mnt'hu. Dyadihamizaga dihili idyo niyo dyatulika vibesubesu. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Aaho kilama kiya no ulongo ne shaba ne disawa ne zahabu vandaga enga nt'hifu ya hant'hu ho kuhetela mwo msimo wo ulozo. Mp'heho niyo yavipuputisa hale hakisigale hata kabesu kamwenga. Mna diya iwe ditulile dihili dyahitukaga kunda mnima mkulu na kumemeza isi yose.<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />“Seuta, aya yose nilongile nayo ulotile. Haluse goja kikutapitile ino isozi yako. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Seuta, weye ywi mkulu mwa maseuta wose. Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu kakwink'ha weye useuta mwa maseuta wose no udahi no ludole no uwedi utendese. <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />Want'hu mwe isi na makala na madege yose yaikwa mwo udahi wako. Kiwalo chako weye ni enga mtwi udya we zahabu. <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />Weye ukeza kuhalawa nowize useuta mtuhu una ludole ludodo naho hiyo enga uwako. Akajika naho nowize useuta mtuhu wa katatu uliganyizwe ne shaba, uwo noulongoze si yose. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Naho nowize useuta mtuhu wa kane uliganyizwe ne kilama, uwo wavitulatula no kuvihonda vint'hu vose. Naivi elo enga ivo kilama kikutulatula na kuvihonda vint'hu vose, useuta uwo houtimile kudamanya enga midamanyile ye ziseuta nt'huhu zomboke. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Enga ivo uwone iviga ne vidole, nt'hili imwenga ulongo wa kuumbila nyungu int'huhu nayo kilama. Nuko kugamba useuta uno noukepange. Mna useuta uwo nounde na ludole lwa kilama ludodo enga ivo uone kilama kihangane no ulongo wa kuumbila nyungu. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Naho enga iivo, vidole ve viga vakwe, nt'hili yakwe ni dya kilama, nt'hili nt'huhu nadyo ulongo. Useuta uwo nawo nounde na ludole mna naho nounde msokezi. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Iviya iviya, enga ivo uone kilama kikehanganye ne ulongo wa kuumbila nyungu, vilongozi wa si nawo nawakehanganye kwa ndoza mna hawalungane enga ivo kilama hekikudaha kulungana no ulongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />Mwo lupisi lwa maseuta awo, Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu naaike useuta utogile houkudaha kubanangwa, want'hu watuhu hawauhume na kuulongoza useuta uwo. Mna useuta uwo nouhondehonde seuta zose nt'huhu, mna woho wenye nowikale mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Naho enga ivo udione diiwe dimokile dyenye ukwo kwo mnima, naho kugamba neditulatula ikilama ne shaba no ulongo ne disawa ne zahabu. Mnungu ajink'hile wose kamgambila seuta kiya kikuunga kilaile. Isozi ino ni ya kindedi naho utapita wakwe nawo ni kindedi.”<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta amtunya Danieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Aho niyo seuta Nebukadineza agwa kifulifuli hasi na kumfikila madi Danieli na kuwagamba want'hu wamlavile nt'hambiko na ubani. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Naho seuta amgambaga Danieli, “Kindedi Mnungu ywako ni Mnungu mkulu kujink'ha milungu yose na Zumbe mkulu kujink'ha maseuta wose, naho niye akugubula kinyele kikefisile, kwaviya weye kakutenda udahe kugubula kinyele iki.” <verse eid="DAN 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Akajika seuta amtunyaga Danieli niyo amwink'ha nt'hunyo ikulise, amtenda kunda kilongozi mkulu mwo ulongozi wa mkowa wose wa Babeli na wata mizungu wose wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Danieli amlombezaga seuta, naye niyo awaika Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego kunda wakimalizi we zimbuli zo ulongozi wa mkowa wa Babeli. Mna Danieli asigalaga mwe dizumba dye kiseuta.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya Nebukadineza kwa want'hu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Seuta Nebukadineza awagambaga want'hu wakwe wadamanye hili dya zahabu, dyandaga na utali wa mita milongo miidi na mnane na uzangalamu wakwe mita nt'hatu. Aikimalisaga hant'hu hekale nt'hindiga hakwitangwa Dula mwe dijimbo dya Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Seuta uyo awetangaga wakulu na wakimalizi na vilongozi na walangilizi na wadima we kindolo na walamuzi na wakulu wose we dijimbo, vileke weze ko wila wa kukonga kudivika dihili idyo adamanye. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Ivo wakulu na wakimalizi na vilongozi na walangilizi na wagwila kodi na wakulu wose we dijimbo wakeduganyaga vileke weze ko wila wa kukonga kudivika dihili idyo adamanye. <verse eid="DAN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Niho mtowa lugong'ondo alongaga kwa izwi kulu akagamba, “Nyuwe want'hu we makabila yose na si zose na milosi yose, mwasigilwa kugamba, <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />umwo mkeza kwiva maizwi ya gunda na mluli na kinubi na zeze na mluli mkulu na maizwi yoyose ya vint'hu vo ukemi, vaungwa mfuname hasi na kudivika dihili dye zahabu idyo akimalise seuta Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Naho yeyose uyo heefuname na kudivika, naadulwe lupisi uulo mwe nunda yo moto ukwakisa.” <verse eid="DAN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Kwa ivo want'hu wose weze weve izwi dya gunda na mluli na kinubi na mazeze na vigoma na zumali na maizwi matuhu yehengi yo ukemi, want'hu wa makabila yose na si na want'hu wa milosi wagwaga hasi na kudivika dihili idyo dya seuta Nebukadineza.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambuyaze watatu wa Danieli walongelezwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Mwo lupisi ulo, wamwenga mwa Wakalidayo wezaga wakawalongeleza Wayahudi. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />Wamgambaga seuta Nebukadineza, “Weye seuta wikale mazuwa yose! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Seuta, nokugamba, kila mnt'hu aneva izwi dya gunda na mluli na kinubi na zeze na kinanda na miluli mikulu na maizwi matuhu ye hengi yo ukemi, vaungwa afuname hasi na kudivika diya dihili dye zahabu, <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />Naho kugamba mnt'hu yeyose heefuname hasi na kudivika milungu iyo, naadulwe mwe nunda yo moto ukwakisa. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Weye seuta, weyuko mwa awo Wayahudi uwenk'hile ukulu we zimbuli ze dijimbo dya Babeli awo Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, want'hu awa hawaitimile sigilizi yako. Walemelaga kudivika dihili ukimalise.”<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Aho Seuta Nebukadineza akanda na maya asigilaga Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego wegalwe kwakwe. Ivo wegalagwa kwa seuta. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Seuta Nebukadineza awauzaga, “Togoleni ni kindedi kugamba weye Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego mlemela kuidamanyila ndima milungu yangu naho hamkudivika dihili dye zahabu iyo niikimalise? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Haluse mneva naho izwi dya gunda na mluli na king'weng'we na zeze na kinubi na maizwi ya vint'hu vituhu va ukemi, nomfuname hasi na kudivika dihili idyo nidamanye. Mna uneva mnalemela mwo lupisi uulo nomdulwe mwe nunda ikwakisa moto. Hangi ni mnungu yuhi naadahe kuwayokolani mwo udahi wangu?”<verse eid="DAN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Niho Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego wamhitula seuta, “Weye Nebukadineza suwe hakikukegombela wenye mwe mbuli ino. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Uneva ni ivo Mnungu ywetu uyo kikumvika naakiyokole mwe nunda yo moto uwo, naho naakiyokole kulawa mwo udahi wako weye seuta. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Mna hata uneva haakiyokole, zumbe ywangu seuta, chaunga umanye kugamba, hekidivike dihili dyako ne milungu yako ye zahabu iyo udamanye.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usengelo wa Danieli na weyawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Niho seuta Nebukadineza andilisaga na maya mwa Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, niyo futa yakwe yahituka kwa kuihizwa. Ivo asigilaga nunda yo moto ikwezelwe nk'hanana mfungate kujink'ha ivo ikundaga. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Naho niyo asigiila mwa awo watowani wakwe wata ludole kujink'ha watuhu wose mwa watowani wakwe wawakake Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego na kuwaduula mwe nunda yo moto ukwakisa. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Ivo wabwanga awo wakakagwa wakanda wavala suluali zawe na nk'hazu zawe na vilemba vawe niyo wadulwa mgati mwe nunda yo moto ukwakisa. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Sigilizi ya seuta yandaga ya luhahila, udya moto wagimbagwa mwe nunda wandilisaga una luhahila, hata ndilija zo moto zawakomaga wadya want'hu wawegale Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Niho Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego wakanda wakakigwa kindedindedi, wadulagwa mwe nunda idya yo moto wandaga ukwakisa. <verse eid="DAN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Aho seuta Nebukadineza niyo ehelwagwa, niyo asunguza kwinuka niyo awauza walangilizi wakwe, “Togoleni hakikakile want'hu watatu na kuwadula mwo moto?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:24">Nawo niyo wamhitula seuta, “Heiye seuta, nivo chatendile!”<verse eid="DAN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />Niyo auza,“Mna haluse nii naona want'hu wane wakugendagenda mndani yo moto haheina kunyinywa hegu kusha naho mnt'hu wa kane aoneka enga mwana ywa milungu?”<verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabwanga walekelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Ivo seuta Nebukadineza aitaga hagihi no mnango we nunda yo moto niyo agamba, “Shadilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, wandima wa Mnungu mkulu ekulanga, foseni kuse mwize uku!” Niyo Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego wafosa mwo moto. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Vilongozi wakulu na wakimalizi na vilongozi na walangilizi wa seuta, wose wakeduganyaga na kuwazunguluka, waonaga kugamba udya umoto noudunduga kuwoka want'hu awo watatu. Fili zawe hazashaga naho mavalo yawe hayashele naho hawandaga na p'hofa yeyose yo moto mwe mili yawe.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Seuta Nebukadineza niyo agamba, “Atogolwe Mnungu ywa Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, kwaviya amtumaga mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu na kuwayokola wandima wakwe awo wamhuwilaga. Awa walemelaga kutimila sigilizi ya seuta naho wazumilaga hata kubanika kujink'ha kuidamanyila ndima hegu kuvika milungu mituhu ila Mnungu ywawe ekedu.<verse eid="DAN 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />“Kwaivo nasigiila kugamba want'hu we dikabila dyodyose na si yoyose na milosi yoyose awo wakuunga walonge kint'hu chochose kiihile mwa Mnungu ywa Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego, nawatulwe vibesu besu. Nyumba zawe nazo nezimoligwe kwaviya hahana mnungu mtuhu akudaha kuyokola enga ivi.”<verse eid="DAN 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Ivo seuta Nebukadineza awaongezela ukulu Shedilaki na Meshaki na Abedinego wande wakulu mwe dijimbo dya Babeli.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s">Sozi ya kaidi ya Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />Miye seuta Nebukadineza, nawawandikila nyuwe want'hu wa makabila yose na si zose na wa milosi yose mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:1">Utondowazi unde kwenyu. <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Hiona vedi kuwagambila kilagiso na mbuli zo kwehela ayo Mnungu ywa kulanga anilagise.<verse eid="DAN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />kaula ivo vili vilagiso va Mnungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">Mbuli zakwe zo kwehela ni nk'hulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:3">Useuta wakwe ni wa mazuwa yose, kulawa cheleko mpaka cheleko.<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />“Miye Nebukadineza nandaga kaya kwe dizumba dyangu dye kiseuta handa naonela kinyemi wikazi wangu, naho kugamba kila kint'hu changu chanigendela vedi. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Nalotaga sozi yanigelaga wogohi. Umwo nandaga higona mwo lusazi lwangu, sozi na maona izo zanombokelaga zanitendaga nogohese. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Ivo nasiigilaga kugamba nigailwe want'hu wose wata mizungu wa Babeli vileke wanigambile sozi iyo. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Mna weze weze wagangana na watowa milamulo na walaguzi na Wakalidayo, nawagambilaga isozi yangu mna hawadahaga kunigambila kiya kikulongwa mwe sozi. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />Uko uuko, Danieli uyo zina dyakwe etangagwa Beliteshaza, ezaga kwangu. danieli uyo akwitangwa Beliteshaza, kwa kutimila dizina dya dya mnungu ywangu, uyo muye ywe milungu ikwikala mwakwe. miye namgambilaga sozi yangu, hamgamba, <verse eid="DAN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />Beliteshaza weye mkulu ywa wagangana, himanya kugamba muye ywe milungu yeekala mwako, naho hahana mbuli ye kinyele ukuidunduga. haluse unigambile isozi yangu naho unigambile kugambile yagaaze.<verse eid="DAN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />“Umwo nandaga higona mwo lusazi lwangu, mwa maona yangu naonaga mti utendese ukulu hagatigati ye isi. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Mti udya wandaga mkulu utendese naho utoga, utali wakwe wabulaga mpaka kwe mbingu, wandaga wauona kila hant'hu mwe isi. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Mani yakwe yandaga yedi. Wandaga umema matunda mengi, mndani mwake kwandaga na nk'hande kwajili ya want'hu wose. Makala mbago yose wekelaga hasi he mp'heho yo mti uwo. Madege ulanga nayo yekalaga mwa matambi yakwe. Viumbwa vose vapataga nk'hande kulawa mwo mti uwo.<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />“Umwo nandaga nikei higona mwo lusazi lwangu naonaga mwamizi akukile andile akaseela kulawa kwe mbingu. <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />Andaga akabilikiza kwa izwi kulu niyo agamba, ‘Kant'heni mti uno naho yakant'heni matambi yakwe, yahauseni mani naho myamwaganise matunda yakwe. Na makala ye hasi yakwe yanyilike na madege yapuluke kulawa mwe matambi. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Mna lekeni disiki dyakwe na maizi yakwe mwo ulongo, dikanda dikakigwa kwa kilama na shaba, isigale mwo ulongo mwa mani ya mwe nyika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:15">“‘Mlekeni ajabazwe nu mnyuzu wa kwe mbingu, naho mlekeni ekale hamwenga na makala mbago, mgatigati mwa maziti. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Umanyi wakwe uhitulwe kulawa udya wa mnt'hu enk'higwe umanyi wa kala, mpaka lwomboke lupisi lwa miyaka mfungate. <verse eid="DAN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />Ulamuzi uno wiza kwa lagizo dya wamizi, usengelo uno ni lugong'ondo lwa wakukile vileke want'hu wose mwe isi kila hant'hu, wamanye kugamba Mnungu Mkulu ana udahi mwo useuta wose wa wat'hu, yehe amwink'ha mnt'hu akumuunga naho amtenda mkulu hata mwa wadya wabeligwe mwa want'hu.’<verse eid="DAN 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />“Seuta niyo agamba.” “Ino niyo sozi nilotile.” “Haluse weye Beliteshaza unigambile kilongingwe mwe sozi ino, kwaviya wata mzungu wose mwo useuta wangu wadunduga kunitapitila, mna weye wadaha kwaviya muye ywe milungu ikukile imndani mwako.”<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danieli atapita isozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Niho Danieli uyo etangwe zina dya Beliteshaza, ehelwagwa kwa lupisi, fanyanyi zakwe nazo zamgelaga kinyulu. Seuta amgambaga, “Beliteshaza, sozi iyo hegu utapita wakwe vise kukwitusa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:19">Beliteshaza niyo amhitula, “Zumbe ywangu, sozi ino nevinda vedi inde ya awo wakukuihiya, utapita wakwe nawo unde kwa wank'hondo wako.” <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Mti uuone ukanda mkulu naho mtali, uwo matambi yakwe matali yakubula kwe mbingu, nawo noukaonekela kila hant'hu mwe isi. <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />Mani yakwe yakanda yedi na matunda yakwe mengi kwajili ya kuwenk'ha nk'hande viumbwa vose, makala mbago nayo yekala mwe mp'heho yakwe, naho madege ulanga nayo yazenga vyaila mwa matambi yakwe.<verse eid="DAN 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />“Zumbe ywangu Seuta, weye niwe umti uwo. Kunda mkulu na mta ludole. Ukulu wako ubula mpaka kwe mbingu, naho useuta wako wenela mpaka kwo uheelo we isi. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Zumbe ywangu seuta wamuonaga mwamizi uyo akukile akaseela kulawa kwe mbingu niyo agamba, ‘Ukant'heni mti uno mkaubanange, mna lekeni disiki na maizi yakwe ikanda yakakigwa kwa kilama na kwa shaba, kwa mani ya mwe nyika umwo maizi yakwe yakanda yasigala mwo ulongo.Mlekeni mnt'hu uyo ajabazwe ni mnyuzu wa kwe mbingu ekale hamwenga na makala mbago kwa miyaka mfungate.’<verse eid="DAN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />“Zumbe ywangu seuta, uno nuwo utapita wakwe, naho ino niyo sigilizi ya ekulanga vitendese ailavile mwa zumbe ywangu seuta. <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />Weye nouguluswe hale na want'hu noukale hamwenga na makala ya kwe mbago noudye mani enga ng'ombe, noujabale kwa mnyuzu wa kwe mbingu. Noukale kwa lupisi lwa miyaka mfungate aho noumanye kugamba Mnungu niye mta udahi mwo useuta wa want'hu, naho amwink'ha mnt'hu yeyose naaunge. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Sigilizi ya kudileka disiki na maizi yo mti uwo mwo ulongo, nuko kugamba nowize uvuzilwe naho useuta wako aho ukeza kukombaganya kugamba Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu niye akulongoza. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Kwaivo, weye seuta ywangu tegeleza ulangilizi wangu. Leka uwavu wako no uwihi wako, udamanye uwagilwa na kuwaonela mbazi wakiwa, vadahika mbuli zako nezigendeele vedi mwa mazuwa yakwiza.”<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaila kwe sozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Ayo yose yamlailaga seuta Nebukadineza. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Ize ibule miezi mlongo na mbili, seuta Nebukadineza andaga akagenda mnanga mwe dizumba dye kiseuta dizengigwe enga tembe mwo mzi wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />Asinyaga kuse niyo agamba, “Uno ni mzi mkulu wa Babeli niuzengile kwa udahi wangu, hiuzenga mzi uno wedi unde ukalo wa kiseuta kwajili yo ukulu wangu”<verse eid="DAN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />Umwo eze alonge ayo, izwi kulawa kwe mbingu niyo dyagamba, “Weye seuta Nebukadineza, ulosi uno ni kwajili yako. Weye kuhokigwa useuta uno. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />Nouguluswe hale na want'hu, ukekale hamwenga na makala mbago kwe nyika, noudye mani enga ng'ombe, nowikale ivo kwa lupisi lwa miyaka mfungate mpaka umanye kugamba Mnungu niye mta udahi mwo useuta wa want'hu naho amwink'ha useuta mnt'hu yeyose akumuunga.”<verse eid="DAN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Aaho mbuli iyo ilongigwe yakint'haga mwa seuta Nebukadineza. Agulusagwa hale na want'hu, akanda adya mani enga ng'ombe na mwili wakwe wajabalaga mnyuzu wa kwe mbingu fili zakwe nazo zandaga nt'hali enga mazoya ya kinga, makombe yakwe yandaga enga makombe ya ngwilizi.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nebukadineza amtogola Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />Wize ubule uheelo wa idya miyaka mfungate, miye Nebukadineza nakaulaga kwe mbingu, umanyi wangu waniuiyaga. Niho namtogola Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu na kumtunya yehe ywa mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">Yehe alongoza mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">useuta wakwe hauna uheelo.<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />Want'hu wose mwe isi awaona hiyo kint'hu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">Watumigwa wa kwe mbingu na want'hu wa mwe isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">we mwo udahi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">Hahali yeyose akudaha kumkindila asekutenda yakumwelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">hegu kumuuza dyodyose mwa yadya akudamanya?<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />“Mwo lupisi ulwo umanyi wangu umwo wize uniuiye, nt'hogola yangu na ukulu wangu navuzilagwa kwajili ya ukulu wo useuta wangu. Walangilizi wangu na vilongozi wambizi wangu wezaga kunizungula, name navuzagwa mwe difumbi dyangu dyo useuta niyo nanda mkulu kujink'ha aho nk'hongo.<verse eid="DAN 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />“Haluse, miye Nebukadineza, namtogola na kumtunya Seuta ywa kwe mbingu. Kwaviya udamanyi wakwe wose ni wa uwagilwa naye uwaseleza wata kukeduvya.”<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s">Ludyo lwa Betishaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Zuwa dimwenga seuta Belishaza awalalika want'hu wabindile wingi wata ukulu na vilongozi weze wadye nk'hande na kunywa divai hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Umwo Belishaza andaga akanywa divai asigilaga vigalwe vyombo va zahabu na masawa ivo seuta Nebukadineza ise andaga kavitaha kulawa mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu uko Yelusalemu vigalwe vileke seuta na wakulu na wambizi wakwe na wawele wakwe wavinyweele. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Kwaivo wavigalaga viya vyombo va zahabu ivo vatahagwa kulawa mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu uko Yelusalemu, seuta na wakulu na wambizi wakwe na wakaziwe na wawele wakwe niyo wavinyweela. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Wanywaga uku wakaitogola milungu idamanywe kwa zahabu na masawa na shaba na kilama na maziti na maiwe.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Kwalailaga vidole va mkono wa mnt'hu niyo vawandika mwo lukandula hagihi ne kinala cho lumuli mndani mwe dizumba dya seuta. Seuta auonaga mkono uwo ukawandika. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />Futa ya seuta yahitukaga, na kogohesa, vimtendile mavindi yakwe yahamizane. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />Seuta Belishaza abongeelaga kwa izwi kugamba, wasai na Wakalidayo wata mizungu na wagangana wa Babeli. Weze wabule ha seuta, yehe niyo awagamba, “Yeyose naadahe kusoma mawandiko aya na kunigambila ivo yakulonga, naavalwe mavalo ya zambalau na mkufu wa zahabu mwe singo yakwe, naye naande kilongozi wa katatu mwo useuta.” <verse eid="DAN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Ivo wata mizungu wose wa seuta niyo weza, mna wadundugaga kuyasoma mawandiko ayo na kudunduga kumgambila seuta kugamba nivo yagaaze. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Ivo seuta Belishaza engilwagwa ni wogohi naho futa yakwe yahitukaga, wakulu na wambizi wakwe wengilwagwa ni kiyangayanga.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Nine dya Betishaza eze eve izwi dya seuta na wakulu na wambizi wakwe, ezaga niyo engila mwo ukumbi we fugo. Niyo agamba, “Weye seuta wikale mazuwa yose. Usekuhituka ifuta yako! <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />Mwo useuta wako eyuko mnt'hu ana muye ywa milungu ikukile mndani mwakwe. Mwo ulongozi wa iso mnt'hu uyo aonekaga kunda na umanyi na ubala na mzungu enga idya ye milungu. Seuta Nebukadineza uyo iso amtendaga kunda mkulu ywa wagangana na wasai na Wakalidayo wata mizungu na walotezi, <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />Uyu Danieli, uyo enk'hagagwa ni iso zina dya Belishaza, mnt'hu uyo aonekaga kunda na umanyi naho mbala naho adaha kutapita sozi, na kugubula mbuli zikefisile. Elo, mwitange Danieli naakutapitile ayo yawandikwe yagaaze.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danieli atapita yawandikwe mwo lukazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Ivo Danieli egalagwa ho undiilo wa seuta, seuta naye amuuzaga, “Togola weye niwe Danieli, yumwenga mwa wadya watahigwe wegalwe ni tate seuta kulawa isi ya Yuda? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Hiva kugamba muye ywa milungu imndani mwako naho kugamba ikwink'ha umanyi na ubala na mizungu. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Wata mizungu na wasai weze wegalwe aha vileke wasome na kunitapitila kikulongwa mwa mawandiko aya, mna woho wadundugaga kunitapitila. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Mna higambilwa kugamba wadaha kunitapitila mawandiko ayo no kuvumbula mbuli zikefisile. Uneva wadaha kusoma mawandiko aya na kunitapitila, nouvaligwe mavalo ya zambalau na mkufu wa zahabu mwe isingo yako, nounde ukulu ywa katatu mwo useuta.”<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Niho Danieli amhitulaga seuta Belishaza, “Ikala na mageleko yako hegu mwink'ha mnt'hu mtuhu. Hata ivo nenisome mawandiko kwajili ya seuta na kukwink'ha utapita wakwe.<verse eid="DAN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />“Weye seuta, Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu amwink'haga Nebukadineza uyo iso, useuta na ukulu na nt'hunyo na nt'hogola. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Kwajili yo luneka eink'higwe iso, makabila yose ya want'hu na si na want'hu wa kila milosi wazingizaga na kumwogoha. Awakomaga want'hu awo aungaga kuwakoma, naho wadya nakaunga kuwaleka wagima, awalekaga wagima na wadya nakaunga awakweze mwo ukulu, awakwezaga wadya nawo akaunga awaseleze, awaselezaga. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Mna eze akonge kunda na wefenyi na kunda mdala na weduvi, ahausagwa kulawa mwe difumbi dyakwe dye kiseuta na kuhokwa ukulu wakwe. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />Agulusagwa hale na want'hu na kunk'higwa ubala enga wa makala mbago niyo ekala na mp'hunda na kudya mani enga ng'ombe, mwili wakwe wajabazagwa kwa mnyuzu wa kwe mbingu mpaka aho amanyaga kugamba Mnungu Ekulanga niye mkulu mwo useuta wa want'hu naye amwiika kunda seuta mnt'hu yoyose akumuunga.<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />“Mna weye Belishaza, hamwenga na kugamba kuyamanya aya yose hukeseleze, <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />vituhu vakwe kukekweza mwenye mwa Zumbe ywa kwe mbingu. Kwigailwa vint'hu vakwe va mwe nyumba yakwe Mnungu. Weye hamwenga na wakulu na wambizi wako na wakaziyo na wawele wako mwavinyweelaga divai, niyo mwaitogola milungu ya masawa na ya zahabu na ya shaba na ya kilama na ya maiwe matuhu, milungu iyo heikudaha kuona hegu kwiva hegu kumanya. Mna humwogohe Mnungu uyo akuutoza ugima wako na sila zako hezikefisile kwakwe. <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Ivi nivo vilekele kasigiila mkono uwandike mawandiko aya.<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />“Aya nayo mawandiko yawandikwe, MENEMENE TEKELI NA PELESI <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />utapita wakwe ni uno, MENE, Mnungu kawaza mazuwa yo useuta wako na kuuheleza. <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />TEKELI nuko kugamba, weye kuhimigwa mwe kihimo, mna kuoneka kuhuhisa. <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />PELESI, nuko kugamba, useuta wako upangwa niyo wenk'higwa Wamedi na Wajemi.”<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Aaho seuta Belishaza niyo awagamba wandima akwe wamvale Danieli valo dya zambalau na mkufu wa zahabu mwe singo. Niyo watowa lugong'ondo lwe zimbuli za Danieli kugamba yehe ni kilongozi ywa katatu mwo useuta. <verse eid="DAN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />Kilo iicho, Belishaza seuta ywa Babeli akomwagwa, <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />niyo Dalio Mmedi enk'higwa useuta akanda na miyaka milongo mtandatu na miidi.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s">Danieli mwe dibome dye zisimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Seuta Dalio aonaga ni vedi asagule wakulu gana dimwenga na milongo miidi wamwambize mwo useuta wakwe wose. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />Iviyaiviya asagulaga wakilmalizi watatu, Danieli akanda yumwenga ywawe, vileke wawakimaile wadya wakulu watuhu kwa kudima upati wa seuta. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Ivo Danieli akelavilizaga mwenye mwa wadya wakimalizi na wakulu kwa nt'hogola ananazo, vilekile seuta akapanga kumwiika kunda mkulu mwe zimbuli zo useuta wose. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Iyo ileka wadya wakulu hamwenga na wakimalizi wagezaga kuzungula mzungu wa kumlongeleza Danieli mwo ukimalizi wakwe mwe zindima ze kiseuta. Mna wadundugaga kupata mzungu kwaviya Danieli andaga mhuwilwa, naho haoneke kunda na uwihi wowose. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Wadya want'hu niyo wagamba, “Hekipate mbuli yoyose ya kumlongeleza Danieli, haluse kizungule kint'hu akudamanya mwo kumvika Mnungu ywakwe.”<verse eid="DAN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Ivo wadya wakulu na wakimalizi kwa hamwenga waitaga kwa seuta niyo wamgamba, “Weye seuta Dalio wikale mazuwa yose! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Wakimalizi wo useuta na wambizi na wakulu na walangilizi na wose wakulongoza kizumilana kugamba seuta alave sigilizi kwa kutigiza kugamba, mnt'hu yoyose akumlombeza mnungu yeyose, kwa lupisi ulo lwa mazuwa milongo mitatu yakwiza, mnt'hu yeyose heekutimila sigilizi iyo, aduulwe mndani mwe dibome dya simba. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />Haluse weye seuta ulave sigilizi naho uigele kiwalo chako vileke ise kuhitulwa, viligane na sigilizi za Wamedi na Waajemi izo hezikudaha kuhitulwa.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Ivo seuta Dalio niyo aika kiwalo sigilizi iyo. <verse eid="DAN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Danieli eze amanye kugamba sigilizi idya itoelwa lugong'ondo, aitaga kwe chumba chakwe cha kulanga icho malanga yakwe yakomokaga kuhinga Yelusalemu. Danieli afikaga madi niyo amlombeza Mnungu ywakwe, nk'hanana nt'hatu kwa zuwa.<verse eid="DAN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Want'hu wadya waikile mzungu mwa Danieli wabunk'hulaga kugamba Danieli alombeza wambizi kwa Mnungu ywakwe. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Ivo want'hu awo waitaga kwa seuta niyo wamlongeleza Danieli kwa idya sigilizi niyo wagamba, “Togola hutoile lugong'ondo kugamba kwa lupisi lwa mazuwa milongo mitatu kusekunda na mnt'hu yoyose akuzumilwa kulombeza kint'hu chochose kwa mnungu yeyose hegu kwa mnt'hu yeyose mna kulawa kwako weye seuta naho yeyose heetimile sigilizi ino naadulwe mwe dibome dya simba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:12">Seuta niyo etikila, “Heiye, nivo vili, viligane ne sigilizi ya Wamedi na Waajemi iyo haikudaha kuhitulwa.”<verse eid="DAN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Niyo wamgamba seuta, “Danieli uyo yumwenga mwa wadya watahigwa kulawa isi ya Yuda hakogohe weye seuta naho hatimile sigilizi iyo wiikile. Yehe alombeza nk'hanana nt'hatu kila zuwa.”<verse eid="DAN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Seuta eze eve mbuli iyo engilagwa ni kinyulu kikulu. Atailaga amyokole Danieli, agezaga kuzungula kila sila ya kumyokola mpaka zuwa dyaswa. <verse eid="DAN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Wadya want'hu waitaga kwa seuta Dalio wakanda fyo niyo wamgamba, weye seuta, “Umanye kugamba viligane ne sigilizi ya Wamedi na Waajemi hahana sigilizi hegu miko iyo seuta ailavaga ikudaha kuhitulwa.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Niho seuta Dalio alava sigilizi akagamba, Danieli agwiligwe na kuduulwa mwe dibome dya simba. Seuta amgambaga Danieli, “Mnungu ywako ukumvika mazuwa yose naakuyokole!” <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Iwe niyo dyegalwa na kuikwa mwo mnomo wa diya dibome, seuta naye niyo adigela kiwalo cho useuta wakwe. Wakulu wambizi wakwe nawo wagelaga viwalo vo ukulu wawe vileke kusekunda na yeyose akudaha kumyokola Danieli mwe dibome. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />Ivo seuta auyaga kwe nyumba yakwe ye kiseuta naho kilo chose hadyaga chochose, ivo hadamanye fugo yoyose, naho hapatile nt'hongo.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Kilokilo, seuta Dalio enukaga niyo asunguza kuita kwe dibome dya simba. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Umwo eze abule hagihi na diya dibome amwitangaga Danieli kwa izwi dya kinyulu, “Danieli mndima ywa Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu, Togola Mnungu ywako ukumvika mazuwa yose kadaha kuzitenda zisimba izo zisekukukoma?” <verse eid="DAN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Danieli niyo amhitula seuta, “Weye seuta wikale mazuwa yose! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />Mnungu ywangu atumaga watumigwa wakwe wa kwe mbingu niyo wafupa milomo ye zisimba izi, nazo hazinikomile kwaviya miye naonekaga hina masa kwakwe naho hidamanye mbuli yoyose iihile kwako weye seuta.”<verse eid="DAN 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />Aho seuta andaga na kinyemi vitendese, niyo alava sigilizi Danieli alavigwe mwe diya dibome. Ivo wamlavaga, Danieli naye andaga hapatile masulumizo yoyose kwaviya nakanda kamhuwila Mnungu ywakwe. <verse eid="DAN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Seuta asigiilaga wadya want'hu wamlongelezaga Danieli kwa lulimi, wagwilwe na kuduulwa mndani mwe diya dibome dye zisimba hamwenga na wavele wawe na wana wawe. Eloo, umwo wandaga wakei mpaka hasi, simba zawagwilaga na kuwafunc'ha niyo zatula mavuha yawe yose.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Niho seuta Dalio awawandikilaga want'hu wa si zose na want'hu wose na milosi yose mwe si yose,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:25">“Mvikilwe! <verse eid="DAN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />Nasigiila kugamba want'hu wose mwo useuta wangu waungwa wamwogohe na kumvika Mnungu ywa Danieli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">kwaviya yehe ni Mnungu mta udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">naye ekala mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">useuta wakwe haukudahika kubanangwa, naho ulongozi wakwe hauna uheelo.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />Yehe akombola na kuyokola, adamanya kilagiso na vihungi kwe mbingu na kwe isi, kwaviya kamhonya Danieli kulawa mwo kukomigwa ni zisimba.”<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Ivo wikazi wa Danieli wandilisaga wedi mwo lupisi lwo ulongozi wa seuta Dalio mwo ulongozi wa Koleshi Muajemi<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s">Sozi ya Danieli ya makala mane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />Mwo mwaka wa nk'hongo wo kulongoza kwakwe seuta Belishaza ywa Babeli, Danieli alotaga sozi na kuona maona akanda kagona mwo lusazi lwakwe. Awandikaga isozi iyo na kutambalisa ayo aonaga. <verse eid="DAN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />Danieli niyo agamba, mwa maona yangu aho nekilo, naonaga mp'heho kulawa nt'hendelo nne kwe si zikavumila mwe bahali nk'hulu. <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />Makala makulu mane, yafosaga mwe bahali iyo kila dimwenga divituhu na weyawe. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />Kala dya nk'hongo dyandaga enga simba naho dyandaga na mawawa enga ya ngwilizi. Handa nikei nakaula mawawa yakwe yahausagwa, nadyo niyo dyenuka na kukimala enga mnt'hu. Niyo dyenk'higwa umanyi wa mnt'hu.<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />Kala dya kaidi dyandaga enga kala dikwitangwa dubu idyo nt'hendelo yakwe imwenga yandaga inukila. Mwo mnomo wakwe dyafundaga mbavu nt'hatu dizitozeleze na meno yakwe. Nevaga izwi dikadigamba, “Haya dya nyama zibindile wingi!”<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />Akajika aho naonaga kala tuhu, idyo dyandaga enga sui ina mawawa mane ya dege mwo mgongo wakwe, naho dyandaga na mitwi mine. Kala idyo dyenk'higwagwa udahi wa kulongoza.<verse eid="DAN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />Naho mwa maona yangu ya nekilo, naonaga kala dya kane dya kwehela na kutisa, dina ludole vitendese. Idi dyandaga na meno makulu ya kilama. Kala idyo dyadyaga na kutulatula vibesu besu na kujatangiza ayo yasigale. Kala idi hiyo enga yadya makala matuhu matatu kwaviya dyandaga na mahembe mlongo. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />Umwo nandaga nakaula mahembe ayo naonaga luhembe lutuhu ludodo lwahotaga mgati mwa yadya mlongo. Mahembe matatu ya ya nk'hongo yang'olwagwa. Naho mwe luhembe ulo lundodo mwandaga na meso enga meso ya mnt'hu na mnomo wandaga ukalonga mbuli za kukeduvya.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usengelo wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />Umwo nandaga nikei nakaula, fumbi dye kiseuta dyaikwagwa aho, Mdala ywa kale ezaga niyo ekala, yehe avalaga suke ing'aile mbee na fili zakwe zang'alaga mbee. Fumbi dyakwe dye kiseuta dyandaga na ndilija za moto na vitozelezo ve difumbi dyakwe vandaga moto ukukweela. <verse eid="DAN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />Kazuto ka moto kandaga kaseela kulawa ho undiilo wakwe, maalufu kwa maalufu niyo ya mvika, mamilioni ya want'hu wakimalaga ho undiilo wakwe. Kitala chakongaga niyo vitabu vagubulwa.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />Nagendeelaga kukaula kwajili ya idya mbuli ya kukeduvya ilongigwe ne mp'hembe idya. Nakaulaga mpaka dikala diya dikachinjigwa, mwili wakwe nawo waduulwagwa mwo moto niyo washa taka. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Makala yadya amatuhu yahambulwagwa udahi wawe mna woho wenye walekagwa wagendeele kwikala kwa lupisi lugihi.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />Mwa maona ya nekilo, naonaga yumwenga enga mwana mnt'hu akeza mwe mavunde, amwitilaga yudya Mdala ywa Kale niyo wanigala ho undiilo wakwe. <verse eid="DAN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />Niyo enk'higwa udahi na ukulu na useuta vileke want'hu wa makabila yose na si yose na milosi yose wamvike. Ulongozi wakwe hounde na uheelo na useuta wakwe houbanangwe.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utambalisi wa maona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />Miye Danieli naonaga maona nogohaga na kunda na kiyangayanga mwo moyo wangu. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Nasogelaga hagihi ha yumwenga mwa wadya wakimale hadya niyo namlombeza anigambile mwa aya yose. Ivo anigambilaga utapita wa maona ayo yose. <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />“Makala ayo amane ni maseuta wane wakulu wakuunga walaile mwe isi. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Mna wakukile wa Mnungu ywa kulanga nawenk'higwe useuta naho nounde wawe mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />Nehaunga nimanye mbuli ya diya dikala dya kane idyo dyandaga divituhu mwa weyewe wose. Dikala dya kwehela naho dyatisisa, idyo dyandaga na meno ya kilama na nk'hombe za shaba. Meno yakwe yandaga ni kwajili ya kubwant'ha na kutulatula, zinyayo zakwe nazo ni kujatangiza ayo yasigale. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Naho naungaga nimanye ziya zimp'hembe mlongo izo dyandaga nazo mwo mtwi wakwe hamwenga ne mp'hembe nt'huhu imwenga ikelavile mwe ziya zint'hatu za nk'hongo zing'okile, idya mp'hembe yandaga na meso na mnomo ivo yalongaga mbuli za kukeduvya iyo yaonekaga kunda na udahi kujink'ha zimp'hembe zint'huhu.<verse eid="DAN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />Umwo nandaga hakaula mp'hembe iyo yandaga ikatowana nk'hondo na wakukile niyo yawahuma, <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />mna yudya Mdala ywa kale enukaga niyo awenk'ha uwagilwa wakukile wa Mnungu naho lupisi lwize lubule awo wakukile niyo wenk'higwa useuta.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />Niyo anigamba, “Kala idyo dya kane ni useuta wa kane uwo ukuunga ulaile mwe isi. Useuta uwo nounde haukiligana na useuta mtuhu, nawo nouibanange si yose, noiijate na kuitula vibesubesu. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Ziya zimp'hembe mlongo ni maseuta mlongo awo wakuunga walaile mwo useuta uwo. Akajink'ha seuta mtuhu naalaile. Useuta uwo nounde uvituhu kwa wadya walongole, naye naawagwese maseuta watatu. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />Uyo naalonge mbuli za kukeduvya ho undiilo wa Mnungu Mkulu na kuwasulumiza wakukile wa Mnungu. naageze kuhitula mazuwa yawe ye kinyemi ne zisigilizi. Want'hu wa Mnungu nawagelwe mwo udahi wakwe kwa lupisi lwa miyaka mitatu na nusu. <verse eid="DAN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Mna kitala cha kwe mbingu nekikale na kusengela, naho udahi wakwe nouhauswe na kubanangwa pele mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />Useuta na udahi na ukulu wo useuta wose mwe isi nawenk'higwe want'hu wakukile wa Mnungu mkulu. Useuta wawe nounde wa mazuwa yose, na wakulu wose nawaweve na kukeseleza kwawe.”<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />Uno nuwo uheelo wa mbuli ino. Fanyanyi zangu miye Danieli zanitendaga nogohe valekaga langi ye ifuta yangu ihituke, mna hyaijalaga mbuli iyo.<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s">Maona ya Danieli ye ndolome ne divulata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Mwo mwaka wa katatu wa kulongoza kwakwe seuta Belishaza, miye Danieli naonaga maona matuhu ukaleka yadya maona ya nk'hongo naonaga. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />Mwe maona aya miye nakeonaga ni mwo mzi ukwitangwa Shushani mwe dijimbo dya Elamu, mzi uzungulusilwe gomela. Mwa maona ayo nakeonaga hikimala hank'handa ho mto Ulai. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />Nize nikaule naonaga dolome dikimala hank'handa yo mto uwo, dolome idyo dyandaga na mahembe maidi matali mna hembe dimwenga dyandilisaga tali naho dyaijink'haga diya tuhu. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Nadionaga didolome diya dikatowana kuhinga usweelo wa zuwa na kwa mkoma mahanya na kwa mwenye mzi. Hahana kala dyodyose dyadahile kuhigana ne didolome idyo hegu yoyose adahaga kukeyokola kulawa mwo udahi wakwe. Dyatendaga vovose ivo dyaungaga naho niyo dyakulisa.<verse eid="DAN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />Umwo nandaga hafanyanya mwe imbuli ino, naonaga vulata dimwenga dina hembe dimwenga dikulise kulawa hagatigati ya meso yakwe. Dyandaga dikapilika kwa kugulukisa mwe si yose haheina kukwafa hasi mwe si. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />Vulata idyo dyezaga na kudibasa diya didolome dina mahembe maidi nidione dikimala hank'handa ho mto. Vulata idyo dyakonga kuditowa didolome dya mahembe maidi kwa maya yakwe yose. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Nadionaga divulata dye dihembe dimwenga dikadisogeela diya didolome dya mahembe maidi. Vulata diya dyandaga na maya vitendese. Dyaditowaga diya didolome dya mahembe maidi. Didolome diya hadyandaga na ludole lwa kuhigana ne divulata. Ivo vulata dyadikinyaga hasi diya didolome na kudisint'hila hasi. Hakwandaga na yeyose adahaga kudiyokola didolome diya kulawa mwo udahi we divulata.<verse eid="DAN 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Vulata diya dyakulisaga, mna kwo uheelo wo ludole lwakwe, luhembe lwakwe lutali lwavunikaga niyo hant'hu hakwe hahota mp'hembe nt'huhu nk'hulu nne zihingile nt'hendelo nne za si. <verse eid="DAN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Mwe imwenga ye mp'hembe izo izine kwahotaga mp'hembe nt'huhu ndodo, iyo nayo yakulisaga niyo yenela kuhinga nt'hendelo ya kwa mwenye mzi na ulailo wa zuwa na kuhinga kwe isi itendese uwedi. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />Luhembe ulo lwakulisaga niyo lwabula mpaka kwe viumbwa va kulanga izo zint'hondo, niyo lwazikinya hasi nt'hondo zimwenga na kuzijatangiza. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />Luhembe ulo lwakefanyanyaga kunda lukulu kumjink'ha mkulu ywe viumbwa va kwe mbingu. Niyo lwahausa zint'hambiko zo kokwa ziya naakatambikilwa Mkulu ywe viumbwa va kwe mbingu. Na kuhalonga vihile ho ukalo wakwe. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Want'hu wa Mnungu wauzumilaga ulongozi wo luhembe, ivo wasagukaga kwa Mnungu naho walulavilaga nt'hambiko uluhembe na kuleka kumlavila Mnungu, luhembe ulwo lwawatendaga want'hu waleke kuhuwila ikindedi naho lwandaga lwadaha kudamanya kila icho nolukaunga kudamanya.<verse eid="DAN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />Naho namwivaga akukile yumwenga akalonga na akukile miyawe akamgamba, “Togola, mbuli zilongigwe mwa maona aya nezigendeele mpaka ini? Malavo ya kokwa za kila zuwa nayasigale mwo kuzaganywa kwa lupisi lwani? Naho ni kwa lupisi lwani kuzaganya na kubananga kila kint'hu nevigendeele na Nyumba ya Mnungu hamwenga nedifyo dya kwe mbingu vigendeele kujatangizwa?”<verse eid="DAN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Yudya akukile ywa nk'hongo amhitulaga miyawe, akamgamba, “Ni kwa lupisi lwa mtondo na visingi alufu mbili na magana matatu, niho Nyumba ya Mnungu neikukizwe naho.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gabilieli atambalisa Maona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Miye Danieli nize niyaone maona aya naho nize nigeze kuyakombaganya, aaho yumwenga enga mnt'hu akimalaga aho nandile, <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />niyo neva izwi dya mnt'hu diketanga kulawa mwo mto Ulai, “Gabilieli, mgambile mnt'hu uyo maona ayo uyaone.” <verse eid="DAN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />Gabilieli ezaga hagihi na hadya hant'hu nikimale, nogohesaga valekaga hafika madi hasi. Mna yehe niyo anigamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 8:17">“Weye mnt'hu, umanye kugamba maona ayo uyaone yalagisa mazuwa yo uheelo.” <verse eid="DAN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />Umwo andaga akalonga na miye, natozagwa na nt'hongo uku handa higona kifulifuli, mna yehe anitozaga na kunikimalisa, <verse eid="DAN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />niyo anigamba, “Tegeleza hugambile, yadya yakuunga yeze yalaile mwo lupisi lwa maya ya Mnungu, kwaviya maona aya yalagisa mazuwa yo uheelo wiikigwe.<verse eid="DAN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />“Indolome idya ye zimp'hembe zimbili uzione zakimala hant'hu ha useuta wa Umedi na Uwajemi. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Divulata dina mazoya mengi dyakimala hant'hu ha seuta ywa Uyunani, diya dihembe dikulu mgati mwa meso yakwe ni seuta ywa nk'hongo. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Diya dihembe divunike niyo hant'hu hadya halaila mahembe mane, nuko kugamba useuta uwo noukepange kunda seuta nne, mna useuta uwo hounde no ludole enga udya useuta wa nk'hongo.<verse eid="DAN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />“Umwo useuta wawe ukeza mpaka kwo uheelo, na wiihi wawe nawo mpaka kwo uheelo, niho neenuke seuta mta luhahila naho mta umanyi wa nyambi. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />Naande na ludole mna hiyo kwa udahi wakwe mwenye, naadamanye ubanangi wa kutisa naho naadahe kudamanya chochose akuunga. Naawabanange want'hu wakulu na want'hu wa Mnungu. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />Kwa upapala wakwe naande mpati mwe mizungu yakwe ya nyambi naye naakeone mwenye kunda ni ywedi kujink'ha yeyose. Want'hu wengi wakakeone kunda hawana uwo, mna kumbe yehe naande kawabananga pele haheina wenye kukemanya. Naho naaunge atowane no Mkulu ywa wakulu, mna naabanangwe pele ikanda hiyo kwa udahi wa mnt'hu. <verse eid="DAN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />Maona ayo mwe malavo ya kisingi na ya mtondo ayo ni ya kindedi, mna uyafise kwaviya ni kinyele naho nolwomboke lupisi lutali mpaka aho yakeza kukint'hizwa.”<verse eid="DAN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />Umwo nayaonaga maona ayo, miye Danieli nasokelesaga niyo nanda mnyonge mwo lusazi kwa mazuwa yabindile wingi. Mna nenukilaga na kudamanya zindima za seuta. Mna maona yadya yaneheelaga, naho hyadahile kuyakombaganya.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s">Danieli awalombezela want'hu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />Mwo mwaka wa nk'hongo wa kulongoza kwakwe Dalio, mwana Ahusuelo mwelekwa ywa Wamedi uyo atendagwa kilongozi mwo useuta wa Babeli, <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" />miye Danieli nandaga nehasoma kwa wengele vitabu viwandikwe Mbuli ya Mnungu iyo amgambilaga mlotezi Yelemia. Mwe mbuli iyo Yelemia awandikaga kugamba, Yelusalemu neikeza kumoligwa pele niyo yasigala mank'halank'hala kwa lupisi lwa miyaka milongo mfungate. <verse eid="DAN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Ivo elo namlombezaga Zumbe Mnungu kwa moyo wangu wose, hamwenga na kufunga, navalaga valo dya gunia na kukebulugiza maivu kulagisa kinyulu changu. <verse eid="DAN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />Namlombezaga Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywangu na kweiila kwajili yo wavu hagamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 9:4">“Zumbe Mnungu ywangu, Mnungu mkulu ywa kutunywa. Weye ywi mhuwilwa mwa malagano na mbazi kwa wadya wakukuunga, na wakudamanya yadya ukuwagamba wadamanye.<verse eid="DAN 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />“Kidamanya wavu na kudamanya yaihile. Kinda waihi na kusaguka, kileka malagizo ne zisigilizi zako. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Hakiwategeleze wandima wako walotezi awo walongaga na maseuta wetu na wakulu wetu na wakale wetu na want'hu wose we isi. <verse eid="DAN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />Zumbe, weye umuwagilwa mna suwe kingila soni mazuwa yose. Mbuli ino ni kindedi kwetu suwe wose kikwikala mwo mzi wa Yuda na mzi wa Yelusalemu na Izilaeli yose na mwe isi za hale uko uwasambazile kwaviya hakindile wahuwilwa kwako. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Zumbe ywangu, suwe na maseuta wetu na wakulu wetu na wakale wetu kingila soni kwaviya kikudamanyila wavu. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Zumbe Mnungu ywetu ni mta mbazi naho wawausila want'hu wavu wawe hata uneva wadamanya wiihi, <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />naho nekilemela kukutegeleza weye Zumbe Mnungu ywetu, hakitimile sigilizi zako izo ukink'hile kwombokela kwa wandima wako walotezi. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Waizilaeli wose waileka sigilizi yako, niyo walemela kuzumila ayo ukulonga. Kwaviya wakudamanyila wavu, ivo waligitwa na vilapi viwandikwe mwe sigilizi ya Musa mndima ywako. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />Kwaivo kukint'hiza yadya ulongile kwetu na vilongozi wetu kwa kukigaila ubanangi mkulu mwo mzi wetu. Naho, mwe si hakunati kulaile kint'hu enga icho kilaile Yelusalemu, <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />enga ivo iwandikwe mwe sigilizi ya Musa, ubanangi uno wose wizile kwetu, mpaka ivi haluse hakinati kikweiile kwako kwa kuleka wavu wetu na kuufanyanya uhuwilwa wako. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />Kwaivo weye Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywetu, kukeika lumwe kukisulumiza, naho niyo watenda ivo kwaviya mazuwa yose weye ayo ukudamanya ni uwagilwa, mna suwe hakikutegeleze.<verse eid="DAN 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />“Haluse weye Zumbe Mnungu ywetu mta ludole uwalavile want'hu wako Misili na kuditenda zina dyako ditunywe mpaka ivi haluse, chagamba kidamanya wavu na uwihi. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Zumbe ywangu, viligane na ivo ukudamanya kwa uwagilwa, usekunda na maya no mzi wako Yelusalemu mnima wako ukukile. Wavu wetu no wiihi wa wakale wetu kiutenda Yelusalemu na want'hu wako vinde vint'hu va kubelwa ni wadya wose wakizunguluke. <verse eid="DAN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />Haluse, weye Mnungu ywetu, tegeleza kulombeza kwangu miye mndima ywako. Kwa mbazi zako uizenge uhya Nyumba yako iyo imoligwe. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />Tegeleza weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu, kaula uone makunt'ho kinanayo na ivo wili mzi uwo ukwitangwa kwa zina dyako. Hakikukulombeza kwaviya kidamanya yakukuwagila, mna ni kwajili ye zimbazi zako zinyingi. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Zumbe ywangu, utegeleze, ukiusile wavu, weye Zumbe, utegeleze naho usekwikalisa, kwajili ye nt'hogola yako. Weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu kwajili yo mzi uno na weli want'hu wako mwenye.”<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumigwa wa kwe mbingu Gabilieli atambalisa ulotezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />Ivo umwo nandaga hagendeela kulombeza na kukeseleza kuhausilwa wavu wa want'hu wangu wa Izilaeli na kudamanya malombezo yangu kwa Zumbe Mnungu kwajili yo mnima wakwe ukukile, <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />umwo handaga nikei mwe kulombeza yudya Gabilieli uyo nimuone mwe maona aho nk'hongo, anizilaga kwa nguzu hant'hu aho nindile. Yandaga mwo lupisi lwa kulava malavo ya kisingi. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />Ivo anigambaga, “Danieli haluse hiza kukwink'ha mzungu na udahi wa kumanya ayo maona. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />Umwo nakongaga kulombeza, Mnungu alavaga uhituzi, name hiza kukugambila uhituzi uwo kwaviya weye kuungiswa ni Mnungu. Kwaivo utegeleze kwa wengele uhituzi uwo na kumanya maona aya.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />“Lupisi lwa majuma mfungate, uwikwa kwajili ya want'hu wako na mwo mzi wako ukukile vileke masa yasile na kuuheleza wavu na wiihi na kwigala uwagilwa wa mazuwa yose, na kugela kiwalo maona na ulotezi na kumhaka mavuta uyo eli akukile. <verse eid="DAN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />Ivo umanye na kukombaganya mbuli ino. Kukongela umwo ilavigwe sigilizi ya kuuzenga uh'ya mzi wa Yelusalemu mpaka kwiza kuhakigwa mavuta, yudya asagulwe, ni lupisi lwa majuma mfungate. Majuma milongo mtandatu na maidi, mzi wa Yelusalemu nouzengwe uh'ya, una sila nk'hulu na mabome makulu, mna mwo lupisi ulo nolunde lwa makunt'ho. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />Umwo yakeza komboka majuma ayo milongo mtandatu na maidi, yudya kilongozi asagulwe ni Mnungu naakomwe naho haasigale na kint'hu. Mzi ne Nyumba ya Mnungu nevibanangwe ne difyo dya watowani dya uyo mkulu akuunga eze. Uheelo wakwe nowize ubule enga lawo ivo dikubananga kila kint'hu, kukanda na nk'hondo na ubanangi enga ivo viikigwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />Kilongozi uyo naaike mwivano na want'hu wengi kwa juma dimwenga. Hagati ye dijuma idyo naaheleze nt'hambiko na malavo. Hant'hu ha kulanga he Nyumba ya Mnungu naadikimalise ihizo dyo ubanangi nadyo nedisigale aho mpaka yudya adikimalise akeza kukomwa enga ivo aikile Mnungu mwenye.”<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s">Maona ya Danieli mwe mbuli yo mto wa Tigilisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />Mwo mwaka wa katatu wa kulongoza kwakwe seuta Koleshi ywa Uwajemi, Danieli uyo etangwagwa Beliteshaza enk'hagwa ugubulo. Ulosi wo ugubulo uwo wandaga wa kindedi kwaviya noukamlagisa nk'hondo nk'hulu. kuukombaganya ulosi weo ugubulo uwo wamwizilaga mwa maona.<verse eid="DAN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Mwo lupisi ulo, miye Danieli nandaga nahongeza kwa lupisi lwa majuma matatu. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />Hidile nk'hande inamwiile naho hidile nyama hegu kunywa divai, naho hihakile mavuta kwa lupisi lwose lwa majuma matatu.<verse eid="DAN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />Mwe dizuwa dya milongo miidi na kane dyo mwezi wa nk'hongo nandaga hikimala mnk'handa yo mto Tigilisi. <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />Nakaulaga kulanga niyo namuona mnt'hu availe valo ding'aile na kukekaka mwe kigudi msipi wa zahabu yedi ilawile Ufazi. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Mwili wakwe wang'alaga enga madini yakwitangwa zabalajadi, futa yakwe yandaga enga lumwemwe, meso yakwe nayo yandaga enga ndilija za moto, mikono yakwe na viga vakwe vang'alaga enga shaba isukulwe, izwi dyakwe dyavumaga enga izwi dya mdugano mkulu wa want'hu.<verse eid="DAN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />Maona aya nayaonaga miye Danieli nikedu. Na wadya want'hu nandaga nawo hawayaonaga maona aya, mna wogohesaga, niyo wanyilika na kugenda kukefisa. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Miye nasigalaga nikedu hakaula maona ayo yakwehela. Ludole lwangu lwanisilaga, langi ye futa yangu nayo yahitukaga valekaga visekunda vihufu kuni kombaganya. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />Umwo nize nive izwi dyakwe nagwaga hasi kifulifuli na kutozwa ni nt'hongo zizamile. <verse eid="DAN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Niyo mkono wanitoza na kunikimalisa, nafikaga madi uku handa hiketozela hasi ne vifumba vangu naho handa nikei nazingiza.<verse eid="DAN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo anigamba, “Danieli weye mnt'hu ukuungiswa, kimala utegeleze kwa wengele mbuli huunga hugambile kwaviya hisigiilwa kwako.” Umwo andaga akanigambila mbuli iyo, miye nakimalaga hazingiza.<verse eid="DAN 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Yehe niyo anigamba, “Danieli usekogoha. Mnungu keva kulombeza kwako, kukongela zuwa diya dya nk'hongo wize uone ni vedi ukeseleze ho undiilo wakwe Mnungu vileke upate kukombaganya. Miye hiza kwajili ya ayo ulombeze. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Mna mkulu ywa maseuta wa Uwajemi anikindilaga kwa lupisi lwa mazuwa milongo miidi na dimwenga, niho Mikaeli yumwenga ywa awo wakulu, ezaga na kunambiza, kwaivo namwasaga uko hamwenga na mkulu ywa maseuta wa Uajemi. <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />Haluse hiza kukugambila mbuli izo zikuunga ziwalaile want'hu wako mwo lupisi ulo lukwiza, kwaviya maona ayo uyaone ni ya lupisi lukwiza.”<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Umwo andaga akanigambila ayo, nafunamilaga hasi niyo nanda hina dya kulonga. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />Niho mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu adosaga mnomo wangu, name nakongaga kulonga hamgamba yudya akimale hagihi na miye, “zumbe ywangu, maona aya yanigaila kinyulu kikulu, naho yanitenda hihungukilwa ni ludole. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Zumbe ywangu miye mndima ywako nadaha vivihi kulonga na weye? Hina ludole naho nasiilwa nu umuye.”<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Yudya mtumigwa aonekaga enga mnt'hu anidosaga naho name niyo nenda na ludole, <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />niyo anigamba, “Usekogoha weye ukuungiswa ni Mnungu, unde na utondowazi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 10:19">Utoge naho unde mdahi, umwo eze kilonganye napataga ludole niyo namgamba, “Zumbe ywangu kwaviya kutenda ninde na ludole longa kiya noukaunga ulonge.”<verse eid="DAN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />Naye anigambaga, “Togola, kumanya nii heza kwako? Haluse neniuye nitowane no mkulu ywa Uajemi, name umwo haita mkulu ywa Uyunani neeze. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Mna nohugambile yadya yawandikwe mwe kitabu che kindedi. Hahana hata yumwenga akunambiza mwa awo ila Mikaeli mwamizi ywenyu.<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />Mwo mwaka wa nk'hongo wa kulongoza kwake seuta Dalio Mmedi, nakimalaga kumwambiza na kumgela ludole. <verse eid="DAN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />Haluse nohugambile kindedi cha mbuli izi.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="DAN 11:2">Useuta wa Misili na Silia</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 11:2">“Maseuta watuhu watatu nawalaile mwe Uwajemi akajika naalaile seuta ywa kane, uyo naande mgoli kujink'ha watuhu wose. Umwo anapata ludole kwajili ya ugoli wakwe, naakonge kuutowa useuta wa Uyunani.<verse eid="DAN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />“Akajika naalaile seuta mta ludole, uyo naalongoze kwa udahi mkulu na kudamanya ivo akuunga. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Hata ivo umwo ananda na ludole useuta wakwe noubanike na kukepanga mwe nt'hendelo nne za kwe mbingu. Welekwa wakwe hawawalongoze hegu useuta wakwe hounde mwo udahi wa ukipe akuilongoza kwaviya useuta wakwe nouguhigwe ni watuhu.<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />“Seuta ywa Misili naande na ludole mna yumwenga ywa wakulu wa watoni wakwe naande na ludole kujimnk'ha yehe, naho ulongozi wakwe nounde utoga. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Akajika myaka migeke nawalungane hamwenga, mwana kike ywa kiseuta ywa Misili naalombigwe kwa seuta ywa Silia vileke wande hamwenga, mna hawagendeele kunda na ludole naho, seuta na welekwa wakwe hawafinyilize, naho uyo mwana kike na mwanawe na watumwa wa kivele awo akuita nawo wose nawakomwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Akajika yumwenga mwa wana wo lukolo lwa uyo mwanakike naande seuta, uyo naawakump'hukile watowani wa seuta ywa Silia na kwingila mwa magomela yawe kwa uhumi. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Naatahe milungu yawe na mahili yawe na vyombo vawe va yombe va masawa na zahabu naho naaite navo kwe isi ya Misili. Kwa lupisi lwa miyaka migeke, seuta ywa Misili haamkup'hukile seuta ywa Silia. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Mna mwo lupisi lukwiza seuta ywa Silia naamkup'hukile seuta ywa Misili, mna naaungwe kuuya mpaka kwe isi yakwe.<verse eid="DAN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />“Hamwenga na ayo, wana wa seuta ywa Silia naaduganye fyo kulu dya watowani na kukeika lumwe kwa nk'hondo. Fyo idyo dya watowani nedihagile isi enga malawo heyekukindilwa, na kugendeela na nk'hondo mpaka mwe digomela dya seuta ywa Misili. <verse eid="DAN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Akajika seuta ywa kwa Misili naakump'huke akanda na maya akatowane na seuta ywa Silia. Seuta ywa Silia naye naaduganye fyo kulu dya watowani mna nedihumwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Umwo seuta ywa Misili akeza kudihuma vihile fyo dya watowani wa Silia na kukoma maalufu, aho niho nawakeduvye, mna haagendeele kunda mhumi.<verse eid="DAN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />“Kwaviya seuta ywa Silia naaduganye fyo kulu dya watowani kujink'ha diya dya nk'hongo, akajika mwe miyaka heikumanyika naauye na na fyo kulu dya watowani na vitowanilo vingi. <verse eid="DAN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />Mwo lupisi ulo want'hu wengi nawasaguke kwa seuta ywa Misili. Want'hu waihi wa si yako weye Danieli nawasaguke vileke wakint'hize maona aya, mna hawapate uhumi. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Niho seuta ywa Silia neeze na kuuzunguluka mzi uwo una gomela ditogile niyo autaha. Watowani wa Misili nawaswese ludole lwa kuwakindila naho hata watowani wawe wadahi wata umanyi wa nk'hondo hawadahe kutowana. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Uyo seuta ywa Silia naadamanye ivo vikumwelela, haheina yoyose akudaha kumhiga. Naaikaile isi Iyedi naho naande na udahi wa kuibananga pele.<verse eid="DAN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />“Uyo seuta ywa Silia akuunga akump'hukile naaike mzungu wa kwiza na fyo dya watowani wakwe wose, naho naaike mwiivano na utondowazi na seuta ywa Misili. Naye neenk'hize mwanawe ywe kike alombigwe naye vileke unde mzungu wa kuukinya useuta uwo, mna mizungu iyo heidahike naho hamwambize dyodyose. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Akajika naazihitukile na kuzikump'hukila isi nyingi zi mnk'handa ye bahali nakuzitaha, mna mkulu ywa watowani mtakwiza naamhume weduvi wakwe, na kumtenda uyo seuta ywa Silia aleke kukeduvya. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Akajika naauye kwa magomela ye isi yakwe mwenye mna naahumwe na kukomwa.<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />“Akajika aho neeze seuta mtuhu naalongoze, uyo naasigile mtoza kodi awatigize want'hu walihe kodi vileke agenyeze ugoli wo useuta wakwe. Hata ivo mwa mazuwa mageke seuta uyo naakomwe. Mna haakomwe kwa maya hegu kwa nk'hondo.”<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta mwavu ywa Silia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu agendeelaga kulonga kugamba, Seuta akutimila kulawa Silia naande ni mnt'hu aihile, heekuungwa kunda seuta, mna neeze kwa kwitukiza, naho naauguhe useuta uwo kwa nyambi. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Yeyose akuunga amhige hata ananda mlavant'hambiko mkulu ywa Mnungu naakomigwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Naho naadamanye mwivano na vilongozi wa si nt'huhu kwa nyambi mna nawazidant'hilize, yehe naagendeele kupata ludole hamwenga na kugamba naalongoze si ndodo. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Fyo dyakwe dya watowani nediyakump'hukile na kuyatowa majimbo yana ugoli, na kudamanya vint'hu heviinati vidamanywe hata na wakale wakwe. Akajika naawapangile want'hu wakwe ivint'hu atahile kwe nk'hondo. Naho naaike mizungu ya kuukump'hukila mizi una magomela, mna mbuli izo zose heziikalise kwa lupisi lutali.<verse eid="DAN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />Mna kwa kukeduvya kwakwe naaduganye fyo kulu dya watowani vileke amkump'hukile seuta ywa Misili uyo naakeike lumwe atowane na fyo kulu dina udahi. Mna seuta uyu ywa Misili naatendelwe nyambi vikuunga vimtende ahumwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Walangilizi wakwe wa hagihi nawo wakuunga wamkome pele. Watowani wakwe wengi nawakomwe, naho fyo dyakwe dya watowani nedihagiilwe hale. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Mna maseuta awo waidi umwo wakanda hamwenga ho ludyo nawadant'hilizane kwaviya myoyo yawe neitaile kudamanya wiihi, mbuli iyo heikint'he kwaviya uheelo nounde mwo lupisi lwiikigwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Seuta ywa Silia nediuye mwe isi yakwe akanda na ugoli mwingi atahile. Mna umwo akauya umoyo wakwe noutaile kuwakoma want'hu we ndagano ya Mnungu. Naadamanye vikumwelela akajika naauye mwe isi yakwe.<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />Mwo lupisi lwiikigwe ni Mnungu naaikump'hukile naho isi ya Misili, mna mwo lupisi ulu mbuli hezikale vedi kwakwe enga ivo andile ligane. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Want'hu wa Loma naho ikwitangwa Kitimu naweze ne zimeli vileke wamhige, yehe naye engila wogohi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 11:30">Ivo nandilise na maya, naho naauye kunyuma akataila kuibananga dini ya want'hu wa Mnungu. Yehe naatimile ulangilizi wa wadya walekile indagano ya Mnungu. <verse eid="DAN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />Watowani wakwe wat nayite na kugela usavu digomela dye Nyuma ya Mnungu, naho naahause malavo ya kokwa ya kila zuwa na kukimalisa ihizo dya ubanangi uko mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Naawaluvye kwa nyambi zakwe wadya wasaguke mwe ndagano, mna wahuwilwa wa Mnungu nawakimale watogile na kugendeela. <verse eid="DAN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />Vilongozi wa Izilaeli wata mzungu nawawahinize want'hu wengi, hata ivo kwa mazuwa mageke nawakomwe kwa sime na kwa moto, na kuhokwa ugoli wawe. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Umwo wakakomwa want'hu wa Mnungu nawapate wambizi ludodo, mna wengi nawatimilane nawo kwa milosi ya utondwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Wamwenga mwa awo vilongozi wata mzungu nawakomwe vileke wahauswe usavu na kusunt'hwa, mpaka mwo lupisi lwo uheelo lwiikigwe ulwo holwinati lubule kwa ivi haluse.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />Seuta ywa Silia naadamanye enga ivo akuunga. naaketunye na kukeduvya kugamba yehe ni mkulu kujink'ha milungu yose na kumhomola Mnungu. Naagendeele kudamanya ivo mpaka aho Mnungu naamsengele, kwaviya kiya kitailwe ni Mnungu kikint'he. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Seuta uyo haitunye milungu ya wakale wakwe, ikanda niyudya mnungu akuungiswa ni wavele na milungu mituhu yoyose, kwaviya naakeike kunda mkulu kujink'ha milungu yose, <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />vituhu vakwe naamtunye mnungu akwamila magomela. kwaviya naamtunye uyo mnungu kwa kumlavila zahabu na masawa na maiwe ya yombe kulu na mageleko matuhu ya ugoli. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />Naayamile magomela yakwe yatogile kwa wambizi wa milungu ya wata kwiza. Naawenk'he nt'hunyo nk'hulu wakumzumila kugamba yehe niye seuta. Naawakweze kunda wakulu mwo undima wawe na kuwapangila viwasa na nk'honde.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />“Mwo lupisi lwo uheelo wa seuta ywa Silia naatowane nk'hondo na seuta ywa Misili. Seuta ywa Silia naye naamkup'hukile kwa magali ya nk'hondo, na watowani wakugendeza falasi na meli wabindile wingi. Naazikup'hukile isi nyingi na komboka mwe isi izo enga malao. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />Naaikup'hukile hata isi idya ya Izilaeli na kukoma maalufu ya want'hu. Mna isi ya Edomu na Moabu na hant'hu hakulu ha Amoni neziyokolwe kulawa mwo udahi wakwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Umwo anazikup'hukila isi izo, hata isi ya Misili heihone. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />Naaguhe kindolo cha zahabu na masawa na vint'hu vose va yombe va mwe isi ya Misili. Want'hu wa Libia na want'hu wa Esiopia nawande want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="DAN 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />“Mna ulosi kulawa ulailo wa zuwa na kwa mwenye mzi nezimtise, naye naahalawe kwa kundilisa na maya na kuwakoma want'hu wengi. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />Akajika naakimalise mahema yakwe ya kiseuta mnk'handa ye bahali no mnima wa Mnungu. Hata ivo naabanike naho hahana yoyose naamwambize.”<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s">Mzuwa yo heelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />“Mwa mazuwa yo uheelo, Mikaeli mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu, uyo mwamizi ywa want'hu wako naalaile. Nokunde na lupisi lwa makunt'ho kujink'ha lupisi lutuhu lwose, kukongela aho si zakongaga kunda aaho. Mna mwo lupisi ulo kila yumwenga mwa want'hu wako uyo zina dyakwe dyawandikagwa mwe kitabu cho ugima naa yokolwe. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Wengi mwa wadya wabanike nawauyuke, watuhu nawapate ugima wa mazuwa yose, watuhu nawo nawapate kubelwa mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Wadya wata mzungu nawang'ale enga ung'azi ivo ukulangaza mwo ulanga na wadya wakuwalongoza watuhu kudamanya ayedi nawang'ale enga nt'hondo mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="DAN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />“Mna weye Danieli mbuli izi ziike mwe kinyele zigubike mwe kitabu na kugela kiwalo mpaka mwo lupisi lwo uheelo. Wengi nawagulukile uko na uko naho umanyi nowongezekele.”<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Niho miye Danieli nakaulaga na kuona want'hu waidi wakimale, yumwenga kakimala mnk'handa yo mto, mtuhu naye nt'hendelo ya kaidi yo mto. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />Uyu yumwenga ywawe amuuzaga yudya availe suke zing'aile uyo akimalaga mnanga mwa mazi yo mto, “Togola mbuli izi zikutisa neziguhe lupisi lwani mpaka zize zisile?”<verse eid="DAN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />Namwivaga yudya mnt'hu avaligwe suke zing'aile, uyo andaga mnanga mwa mazi yo mto, aho enulaga mikono yakwe yose miidi kuhinga kwe mbingu, akakelisa kwa zina dya yudya akwikala mazuwa yose, akagamba, “Neinde misimo mitatu na nusu. Mbuli izi zose nezisile aho want'hu wa Mnungu wakeza kuleka kutowana na awo wandaga chotoko cha masulumizo yawe.”<verse eid="DAN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Naivaga mna himanyize. Niyo namuuza, Zumbe ywangu, “Uheelo wa mbuli izi nezinde ini?”<verse eid="DAN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Niyo anigamba, “Danieli weye keitile kwaviya mbuli izi ni kinyele mpaka mwo lupisi lwo uheelo. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />Want'hu wengi nawakekukize na kuhauswa usavu na kusunt'higwa mna want'hu wavu nawagendeele kudamanya wavu. Hahana hata yumwenga mwa awo waihi akuunga amanye mna wadya wata mzungu nawo wakuunga wamanye.<verse eid="DAN 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />“Kukongela mwo lupisi ludya lwa kuhauswa kwa malavo yo kokwa kila zuwa, kulawa aho mnk'hondo akeza kuika kint'hu cha kuihiza kikuunga kigale makunt'ho mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, neinde kwa lupisi lwa mazuwa alufu imwenga magana maidi na milongo kenda. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Kavikilwa mnt'hu yudya akufinyiliza mpaka mwo uheelo ya mazuwa alufu imwenga magana matatu na milongo matatu na shano!<verse eid="DAN 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />“Mna weye Danieli, ita kakehumuile. Lupisi ulo lukeza kubula nouuyulwe vileke uhokele nt'hunyo yako.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>